WEBVTT

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:03.760
and move beyond the segregated spaces
that we live in, every day of our lives.

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:07.360
I believe

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:14.200
that we can achieve this
if we set our minds

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:18.280
and hopes on the prize.

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:23.120
The question before us tonight

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:27.240
is very serious.

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:32.240
It is: "Do you want to be healed?